{
  "input": {
    "handle": "jumprize-lalapen",
    "title": "Jumprize Lalapen",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>LALAPEN is a diving pencil designed exclusively for plug casting games targeting large bluefish and tuna.</span><br /><span>In the past, it has been difficult to combine response, action, body strength, and flight distance with ABS materials due to specific gravity issues.</span><br /><span>However, with the combination of more than two years of thorough actual fishing tests and cutting-edge development technology, the ultimate diving pencil that far exceeds the limits of ABS materials has been completed. Not only offshore, but also in blue casting games from the shore, which has become popular in recent years. The highest level of the shore game's harsh fishing that can never be avoided with lure loss and damage. Body strength and durability are essential for this game, and only those who can attack vigorously without hesitation without fear of damage or lost can encounter large blue things.</span></p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length </span>165 mm - Gr. 53</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length </span>200 mm - Gr. 100</p></li><li><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\"><span>Length </span>240 mm - Gr. 135</p></li></ul>",
